Data and ideas from the R packages ccc and cccLLM

The local database of the Colombian Constitutional Court built by
herramientas/exportar_ccc.R and herramientas/construir_indice.py, and the
citation-network approach used in herramientas/red_citas.py, come from the R
packages ccc (https://github.com/acastroaraujo/ccc) and cccLLM
(https://github.com/acastroaraujo/cccLLM), released under the MIT license:

  ccc     YEAR: 2020  COPYRIGHT HOLDER: andrés castro araújo
  cccLLM  YEAR: 2025  COPYRIGHT HOLDER: Andrés Castro Araújo

This repository does not redistribute that data; the scripts rebuild it on
each computer from the installed packages. Any copy of the rebuilt data must
keep the copyright notice above.
